# This repo deploys the Streamlit app and nothing else. Tracked files:
#   app.py, data_loader.py, train_models.py,
#   models.joblib, requirements.txt
#
# The raw sighting records are deliberately NOT tracked. app.py loads the
# pre-trained trees from models.joblib, so the workbook is only needed
# locally when re-running train_models.py.
#
# Each rule below ignores a whole class of file, then re-includes the ones
# the app needs. ORDER MATTERS: a negation must come after the pattern it
# overrides, or the app silently loses its code or its models.

# Python: keep the app, its loader and the training script
# (drops the 01-03 pipeline and q1-q4 analysis scripts).
*.py
!app.py
!data_loader.py
!train_models.py

# Data: none of it ships. Raw source, intermediate pipeline outputs and
# Copernicus downloads all stay local.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.nc

# Excel lock files, created while a workbook is open in Excel
~$*

# Generated analysis outputs (q1-q4)
outputs/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
